LeetCode 121 – Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock

### Problem kya bol raha hai?

Example:

```text
prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]
```

Humein:

* **ek din Buy** karna hai
* uske **baad wale kisi din Sell** karna hai
* maximum profit nikalna hai

Example:

```text
Buy = 1
Sell = 6

Profit = 6 - 1 = 5
```

Answer:

```text
5
```

---

## Simple Java Solution

Aap Java practice kar rahe ho, isliye Java mein dekho:

```java
class Solution {
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {

        int minPrice = prices[0];
        int maxProfit = 0;

        for (int i = 1; i < prices.length; i++) {

            // Aaj se pehle ka minimum buying price
            minPrice = Math.min(minPrice, prices[i]);

            // Aaj sell karne par kitna profit hoga
            int profit = prices[i] - minPrice;

            // Maximum profit store karo
            maxProfit = Math.max(maxProfit, profit);
        }

        return maxProfit;
    }
}
```

### Isko example se samjho

```text
prices = [7, 1, 5, 3, 6, 4]
```

| Day | Price | minPrice | Profit | maxProfit |
| --- | ----: | -------: | -----: | --------: |
| 1   |     7 |        7 |      - |         0 |
| 2   |     1 |        1 |      0 |         0 |
| 3   |     5 |        1 |      4 |         4 |
| 4   |     3 |        1 |      2 |         4 |
| 5   |     6 |        1 |      5 |         5 |
| 6   |     4 |        1 |      3 |         5 |

Final:

```text
return 5
```

### Main logic sirf itna hai

```text
minimum buying price dhundo
          ↓
current price pe sell karo
          ↓
profit = current price - minimum price
          ↓
maximum profit save karo
```
Agar chaho to main is problem ko **bilkul beginner level pe `minPrice`, `profit`, `maxProfit` har line kaise change ho raha hai** diagram ke saath samjha deta hoon.

